00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:56.210
Trump would implode in seconds, and that may
actually be an interesting narrative to try

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.729
to go Donald Trump into testifying.

00:04:58.729 --> 00:05:00.460
Remind him, Hillary did it.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.460
Hillary did it.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:04.240
Now the circumstances are completely different,
but this is Trump.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.240
We're talking about.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:09.659
He wants to be bigger and stronger and more
