00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.680
Unlikely.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.669
Final note, I don't think that if Bolton testifies,
Republicans vote to impeach.

00:05:19.669 --> 00:05:20.669
Okay.

00:05:20.669 --> 00:05:21.669
I've said this before.

00:05:21.669 --> 00:05:26.930
I believe if Bolton testifies, Republicans
still vote to acquit, but it will be that

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:34.310
